<title>GERMANY: Hoechst to change short code for trading.</title>
<headline>Hoechst to change short code for trading.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Dresdner Bank said on Tuesday that the short code by which shares in Hoechst AG, the chemical firm, are traded on the stock exchange, would be changed from &quot;HFA&quot; to &quot;HOE&quot; as of July 21.</p>
<p>Dresdner said it was making the announcement of the change on behalf of Hoechst.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
